      <trans-unit id="ValueSet-mii-vs-labor-loinc-ontology-hemoglobin-complete" resname="ValueSet.description">
             <notes>
               <note id="n1">ValueSet.description</note>
             </notes>
        <source>Proposal: use-case ValueSet 'Complete aggregation' for the analyte hemoglobin (Everything mapped to the component: any Scale type, any Property, any specimen. Defines the candidate pool = upper bound. Includes the generic 'Measurement of X' grouper concepts.). Candidate pool = &lt;&lt; 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : &lt;&lt; 246093002 |Component (attribute)| = 38082009 |Hemoglobin (substance)| against the LOINC Ontology 2026-03-21. 89 concepts (89 with LOINC). The pool ECL is carried as an intensional include.</source>
        <target></target>
      </trans-unit>
